OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland's security
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US and Denmark have announced a
OL,7,Fdeal on Greenland's security and say
OL,8,Fthe agreement will be signed next week.
OL,10,FUS President Donald Trump said the
OL,11,Fagreement would grant the US "permanent
OL,12,Fcontrol over security, and all other
OL,13,Fneeds".
OL,15,FDenmark's Prime Minister said the deal
OL,16,Fwould "strengthens security in the
OL,17,FArctic and the North Atlantic area" but
OL,18,Fdid address specifics in the agreement
OL,19,Fthat Trump mentioned in a social media
OL,20,Fpost.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
