OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland's security
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deal comes after months of threats
OL,7,Fby Trump to "take" Greenland over
OL,8,Fnational security concerns, citing its
OL,9,Fstrategic location for defence purposes
OL,10,Fand its mineral wealth.
